{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415027","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415027","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041502701:1":{"text":"隊長が以前買ったリンゴが私のところにあるのですが、もうじき腐ってしまいそうですよ？","source_cn":"特弥希娅，你之前买的苹果还放在我这里，快要坏掉了，你还要吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x689F1BE3A4252EAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041502702:1":{"text":"あっ、リンゴ！すまない、失念していた。まだ無事なものはあるか？いくつかもらおう。","source_cn":"啊，苹果！抱歉，我完全忘了，还有好的吗？给我拿几个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x897D94DAA28F375E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041502703:1":{"text":"暁はリンゴが大好きなのだが、最近はアタランテがいつもニンジンを与えているから、暁が怒っているんだ……","source_cn":"晨曦那孩子特别爱吃这些，最近阿塔兰忒总拿胡萝卜代替，晨...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C53DEB8D3C0B739","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1041502703":{"text":"暁はリンゴが大好きなのだが、最近はアタランテがいつもニンジンを与えているから、暁が怒っているんだ……","source_cn":"晨曦那孩子特别爱吃这些，最近阿塔兰忒总拿胡萝卜代替，晨曦都生气了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C53DEB8D3C0B739","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041502704:1":{"text":"あぁ、私たちは最近時々共に行動しているんだ。彼女は聞き込みが得意だからな……","source_cn":"啊，我们最近偶尔会结伴行动，因为阿塔兰忒很擅长打听情报……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x552DB3E5384616BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_