_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041502710:1":{"text":"だから、暁の食事を作っている時に一杯すくってみたんだ。","source_cn":"所以就趁着给晨曦煮食物时自己舀一碗出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFABB9FE775030207","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041502711:1":{"text":"で、でも、味は保証する。","source_cn":"但、但是，我可以保证，味道很不错哦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D11C68C31DDC779","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041502712:1":{"text":"暁も美味しいとは思っていないと思います……","source_cn":"我也可以保证，就连晨曦都觉得那个味道不怎么样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCE30AD40B177D11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041502713:1":{"text":"どの食材も馬の大好物なのに、なぜ出来上がる料理がこんなんですかね。","source_cn":"明明每种材料都是马的最爱，不知道你怎么煮出来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EC12268B3B2E593","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1041502713":{"text":"どの食材も馬の大好物なのに、なぜ出来上がる料理がこんなんですかね。","source_cn":"明明每种材料都是马的最爱，不知道你怎么煮出来的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EC12268B3B2E593","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"",